cosmic-ext-halcyon (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep music progress and elapsed time visible after seeking in browser
    players, including repeated seeks and temporary missing duration data.
  * Avoid marking Islands as crashed when the COSMIC compositor shuts down
    during logout or reboot. The matching Islands add-on includes this fix.
  * Refresh the project presentation and release installation instructions.

